OL,3,ARelief, tears and sadness: Married at
OL,4,AFirst Sight UK cast react to show being
OL,5,Aaxed
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm delighted and so relieved no-one
OL,8,Felse will have to go through the same
OL,9,Fagain."
OL,11,FThat's what one woman - who alleged she
OL,12,Fwas raped on Married at First Sight UK
OL,13,F- texted to me, as the news broke that
OL,14,Fthe show was being cancelled.
OL,16,FAnother woman, who also says her
OL,17,Fon-screen husband raped her, was in
OL,18,Ftears at the news. She told us she felt
OL,19,F"great, consuming relief", but added
OL,20,Fshe was "astounded" it had taken an
OL,21,Fexternal review for Channel 4 to
OL,22,Ffinally pull the plug on the show.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
